The API endpoints in Evidently are authenticated using Bearer tokens. This is specified in the OpenAPI security scheme as follows:

```json
"security": [
  {
    "bearerAuth": []
  }
]
```

This means that each request made to the API must include a Bearer token for authentication [Introduction](https://github.com/evidentlyai/evidently/blob/main/docs-main/api-reference/introduction.mdx).
